{"unit_id":"xmanrui__dsh-feishu#feature-multi-bot","repo":"xmanrui/dsh-feishu","commit":"9510b7758af5f393ca5cb0fabacc780a6b7b1d0b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@xmanrui/dsh-feishu 的功能「多机器人扫码接入」：设置页可以启动飞书应用扫码注册；Host 保存每个机器人的凭据并建立独立连接。再次添加可管理多个机器人。。通过设置页操作或飞书消息事件触发，处理结果由飞书机器人返回。","source":"generated","evidence":["plugin-src/client/index.js:18","plugin-src/host/production.mjs:43"]}
{"unit_id":"xmanrui__dsh-feishu#feature-streaming","repo":"xmanrui/dsh-feishu","commit":"9510b7758af5f393ca5cb0fabacc780a6b7b1d0b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@xmanrui/dsh-feishu 的功能「流式卡片回复」：将 Harness 生成的 Markdown 逐步更新到飞书交互卡片，完成后结束流式状态；失败时尝试撤回卡片。由消息回复流程触发。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/feishu-channel.mjs:48"]}
